":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/BidirectionalDirectedGraph","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"BidirectionalDirectedGraph"}],"url":"\/documentation\/graphprotocols\/bidirectionaldirectedgraph","title":"BidirectionalDirectedGraph"},"doc://Grafluent/documentation/Grafluent/BipartiteGraphs-BipartiteGraph-Extensions":{"title":"Extensions to BipartiteGraph","kind":"article","role":"collectionGroup","abstract":[{"text":"Members other modules add to ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/BipartiteGraphs\/documentation\/BipartiteGraphs\/BipartiteGraph","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/grafluent\/bipartitegraphs-bipartitegraph-extensions","identifier":"doc:\/\/Grafluent\/documentation\/Grafluent\/BipartiteGraphs-BipartiteGraph-Extensions","type":"topic"},"doc://Grafluent/documentation/Grafluent/GraphProtocols-DirectedHypergraph-Extensions":{"url":"\/documentation\/grafluent\/graphprotocols-directedhypergraph-extensions","identifier":"doc:\/\/Grafluent\/documentation\/Grafluent\/GraphProtocols-DirectedHypergraph-Extensions","type":"topic","kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Members other modules add to "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedHypergraph","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"role":"collectionGroup","title":"Extensions to DirectedHypergraph"},"doc://Grafluent/documentation/Grafluent/GraphProtocols-DirectedGraph-Extensions":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Grafluent\/documentation\/Grafluent\/GraphProtocols-DirectedGraph-Extensions","url":"\/documentation\/grafluent\/graphprotocols-directedgraph-extensions","type":"topic","kind":"article","abstract":[{"text":"Members other modules add to ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"role":"collectionGroup",